Package: armatos-voice
Version: 2779.1
Section: shells
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash (>= 5.1), python3
Maintainer: factionparadox <factionparadox@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: the voice of the legion
 Gives interactive bash the Armatos voice: the daily acta in the Roman
 calendar, the imperator@roma prompt, Latin reports when commands fail or
 finish, and a farewell. Latin by default; write "en" to
 ~/.config/armatos/lingua for English. Scripts and pipes are never affected.
